<title>NETHERLANDS: EU urges Palestinian state option.</title>
<headline>EU urges Palestinian state option.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union appealed to the peoples of the Middle East and their rulers to renew peace negotiations and for the first time urged Israel not to rule out the possibility of a Palestinian state.</p>
<p>In a statement issued at their Amsterdam summit, EU leaders said: &quot;Europe calls on the people of Israel to recognise the right of the Palestinian to exercise self-determination, without excluding the option of a state.&quot;</p>
</text>
